---
import BaseLayout from '~/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  locale="en"
  title="Sustainability & HSEQ \u2014 NORSE Diamond Drilling"
  description="How NORSE and X Drill approach safety, health, environment, and quality across Nordic drilling operations."
  path={Astro.url.pathname}
>
  <section class="border-b border-light-grey bg-aquatic text-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20">
      <p class="mb-4 text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/80">
        Sustainability &amp; HSEQ
      </p>
      <h1 class="max-w-3xl font-display text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight md:text-5xl">
        Clean sites. Safe crews. Honest numbers.
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/90">
        Drilling happens in sensitive landscapes. Our standard is that a site should look the same
        when we leave as when we arrived &mdash; and that no one gets hurt getting there.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-white">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6 py-20">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Environment</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-rocky-80">
            Wide rubber tracks, environmental hydraulic oils, and complete site restoration after
            every X Drill job. Policy, certifications, and figures land with the content migration.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Safety</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-rocky-80">
            GWO, ESA, SSG Heta arbeten certifications for the X Drill wind-power crews. NORSE
            drilling crew certifications listed in full on the content migration.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h2 class="font-display text-xl font-semibold">Quality</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-rocky-80">
            Traceable core, chain-of-custody on samples, reporting aligned with CIM/NI 43-101
            where applicable. Full QA/QC framework lands with the content migration.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
